{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 40, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "\"Discovering Japan: A Journey of a Lifetime\"\n\nMy recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the moment I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the unique blend of traditional and modern culture that permeates every aspect of Japanese life. I spent my days exploring the bustling streets of Tokyo, marveling at the towering skyscrapers and neon lights that illuminate the city.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Fish Market, where I sampled the freshest sushi I've ever had. I also had the opportunity to experience the serene beauty of Japan's natural landscapes, including the stunning gardens and temples of Kyoto.\n\nAs I wandered through the ancient streets of Kyoto, I was struck by the tranquility and elegance of the traditional Japanese architecture. The intricate carvings and ornate details on the temples and shrines were breathtaking, and I felt a deep sense of peace and calm as I strolled through the gardens.\n\nJapan is a country that seamlessly blends old and new, and my trip was a fascinating glimpse into its rich culture and history. From the cutting-edge technology and innovative cuisine to the traditional temples and gardens, Japan has something to offer every traveler. I'm already planning my next trip back to this incredible country.", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"", "logprob": -1.4752216339111328}, {"token": "Discover", "logprob": -0.009767360053956509}, {"token": "ing", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.04859822988510132}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.0004676678800024092}, {"token": " A", "logprob": -6.318072337307967e-06}, {"token": " Journey", "logprob": -0.03550039604306221}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.02154586836695671}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.5468695759773254}, {"token": " Lifetime", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "\"\n\n",